  "description": "A network of sources and targets drawn on a canvas, quick for big networks: lines as thick as their counts, with arrowheads and dots flowing the way the counts went, and the nodes of a group drawn as one node for it unless it is expanded. Nodes are coloured by group, or by how busy they are.\nVersion: 4.0.0-SNAPSHOT",
